  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added a visual field picker to \"Fill fields (XFA)\": click fields directly in the rendered document (bundled pdf.js + WebView2) to add them to the values table, with row reordering, per-row error indicators, a \"Preview with data\" button that fills the rendered document without saving, and Ok/Cancel semantics. When WebView2 Runtime is not installed, the activity automatically falls back to a manual field table (with a field-list refresh button) instead of losing functionality. Fixed an out-of-memory/hang issue caused by validating every field synchronously on each keystroke, and a related crash when editing fields. Fixed field validation and execution incorrectly reporting valid fields as \"not found\" on multi-page forms and templates with anonymous layout subforms. Fixed the \"Fill unbound fields\" setting being lost when a task authored on a machine with WebView2 is later run on a machine without it. Fixed the visual picker sometimes adding a duplicate row instead of selecting an already-picked field. Added a warning when clicking a form container instead of a fillable field, and the document name (or source variable) is now shown in the field picker window title.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
